# Large robot artifacts are opt-in. Keep documentation and manifests tracked.
robots/*/data/**
!robots/*/data/README.md
!robots/*/data/manifest.csv
robots/*/checkpoints/**
!robots/*/checkpoints/README.md
!robots/*/checkpoints/manifest.csv
robots/*/real_world_videos/**
!robots/*/real_world_videos/README.md
!robots/*/real_world_videos/manifest.csv

